        "location": {
          "country": "Ghana"
        },
        "summary": "Kwesi Ofori Junior is the Founder and Executive Director of SME GrowAfrica (SMEGA), one of Ghana’s leading platforms advancing small and medium enterprises since 2013. A dynamic entrepreneur and business consultant who drives programs that accelerate SME growth, innovation, and competitiveness across Africa.\nHe has partnered with organizations such as MTN Ghana, the Ministry of Trade & Industry, Ghana Enterprise Agency (GEA), Ghana Investment Promotion Centre (GIPC), and international partners like PUM Netherlands, while also collaborating with universities, Insurance companies and Banks to establish entrepreneurship hubs and incubation programs. Through SMEGA’s award scheme, capacity-building initiatives, and its Access to Market Program under the OneAfrica online marketplace, Kwesi has supported SMEs to embrace digitalization and expand globally.\nAt the Tamil Nadu Global Startup Summit 2025, he shares insights on Africa’s entrepreneurship ecosystem, cross-continental partnerships, and sustainable growth strategies.",
