        "summary": "Yamato Nakamoto is the Global Manager at STARTUP HOKKAIDO, leading ecosystem building and startup support initiatives in Hokkaido, Japan. With over six years at STARTUP HOKKAIDO, he has been instrumental in launching collaborative networks for startup funding and mentorship, including the HOKKAIDO STARTUP RUNWAY. He also founded Kantominto Inc., reflecting his entrepreneurial background. Nakamoto actively promotes international startup collaboration and innovation, making him a key voice for connecting global startup ecosystems. His session at the Tamil Nadu Global Startup Summit 2025 promises valuable insights on scaling startups through cross-sector partnerships and ecosystem development.\n",
