  "about": "Speakers:\nOluwaseyi Abiodun Adepoju – Senior Consultant, Digital Trade & Investment, Office of Nigeria Digital Innovation (NITDA), Federal Ministry of Communications, Innovation and Digital Economy\nHeminda Nishan Jayaweera – Executive Director, TRACE Sri Lanka\n\nKwesi Junior Ofori – Founder & Executive Director, SME GrowAfrica LBG\n\nYamato Nakamoto – Global Manager, STARTUP HOKKAIDO / STEP SAPPORO\n\nThis session explores how cross-border collaboration is shaping the startup ecosystems of the future. It highlights global best practices, digital trade, and innovation hubs driving inclusive growth beyond geographical limits. Attendees will gain insights into building borderless networks, attracting international investment, and designing resilient ecosystems for 2030.",
